{"unit_id":"SteelUnion__dsh-softsensor-hub#card-zh","repo":"SteelUnion/dsh-softsensor-hub","commit":"71eaf2f7e90e861a6c2960504d17ee4e100c7f9c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Softsensor Hub 是面向 DSH 的消息中枢与后台采集插件：它在进程内运行采集器，把外部或本机数据整理成事件，再由可热加载的规则决定通知级别和投递方式。内置采集器覆盖系统状态、邮件、天气和本地量化行情；事件可存入 DSH storageDomain，或退回文件存储。用户可以配置采集周期、关注城市、邮箱和证券代码，并通过 CLI 查询天气或管理消息。适合希望让 DSH 接收经过筛选的系统与日常信息、避免每个数据源各自实现通知逻辑的用户。使用前按需配置邮箱凭据、本地量化数据库或天气位置；天气可调用 Open-Meteo，并可选择 IP 定位。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:547-567","lib/index.js:578-649","lib/collector.mjs:1-15","lib/collectors/weather.mjs:337-398","lib/collectors/finance.mjs:263-315"]}
{"unit_id":"SteelUnion__dsh-softsensor-hub#card-en","repo":"SteelUnion/dsh-softsensor-hub","commit":"71eaf2f7e90e861a6c2960504d17ee4e100c7f9c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Softsensor Hub collects data as events and applies reloadable rules to select notification levels and channels. In-process collectors cover system status, email, weather, and local market data. Events use DSH storageDomain or file fallback. Weather can query Open-Meteo and optional IP lookup.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:547-567","lib/index.js:578-649","lib/collector.mjs:1-15","lib/collectors/weather.mjs:337-398","lib/collectors/finance.mjs:263-315"]}
