{"unit_id":"SteelUnion__dsh-softsensor-hub#feature-1","repo":"SteelUnion/dsh-softsensor-hub","commit":"71eaf2f7e90e861a6c2960504d17ee4e100c7f9c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Softsensor Hub 的功能「分级事件通知」：采集器产出的事件可交给规则引擎匹配，并选择 window、wake、batch 或 archive 等渠道。修改规则文件后，规则引擎支持重新加载。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/rules.mjs:17-20","lib/index.js:529-545"]}
{"unit_id":"SteelUnion__dsh-softsensor-hub#feature-2","repo":"SteelUnion/dsh-softsensor-hub","commit":"71eaf2f7e90e861a6c2960504d17ee4e100c7f9c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Softsensor Hub 的功能「天气采集」：按配置城市或可选 IP 定位取得坐标，定时查询预报并生成天气事件，也可记录天气变化；城市和历史状态由采集器状态接口保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/collectors/weather.mjs:337-398","lib/collectors/weather.mjs:452-480"]}
{"unit_id":"SteelUnion__dsh-softsensor-hub#feature-3","repo":"SteelUnion/dsh-softsensor-hub","commit":"71eaf2f7e90e861a6c2960504d17ee4e100c7f9c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Softsensor Hub 的功能「邮件事件采集」：为配置的邮箱通过 IMAP 定期读取新邮件信息，将邮件转换为事件；邮件地址、凭据引用和单次采集数量由配置控制。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/collectors/mail.mjs:436-480","lib/index.js:578-603"]}
{"unit_id":"SteelUnion__dsh-softsensor-hub#feature-4","repo":"SteelUnion/dsh-softsensor-hub","commit":"71eaf2f7e90e861a6c2960504d17ee4e100c7f9c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Softsensor Hub 的功能「行情事件」：配置本地量化数据库和关注证券后，采集器读取历史行情并生成行情变化事件；数据库路径未设置或关注列表为空时会跳过采集。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/collectors/finance.mjs:263-315"]}
